  AppUserDetails principal = new AppUserDetails("u-1", "x@y.z", "X", "active"); 
  Authentication unauth = new UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken(principal, null); 
  // constructor without authorities defaults isAuthenticated=true; explicit setAuthenticated(false) is mandatory: 
  unauth.setAuthenticated(false); 
  ... StepVerifier ... expectError(AppException.class) ... 
Now the only thing keeping the test green is the isAuthenticated() check; remove that predicate and the test fails. Two-line change.

